      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW YARIS (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (25.72) in a Grade 5 at Warrnambool. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Should be very hard to beat this time. SNOW ROAD (2) is progressing well scoring last time out (34.60) at Sandown and bringing up her 5th career win. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. One of the key runners again. ASTON BARRISTER (6) unwanted in betting but showed good early dash and led until late, finishing second and beaten 2 lengths (30.27) at The Meadows in a Grade 5 over 525m. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Can feature again. BLAZING TURBO (7) is a last-start placegetter worth considering.",
